						"merged_at": null
					},
					"body": "## Motivation\n\nOut-of-tree platforms need a supported causal Conv1D extension point without replacing module globals at runtime.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Wrap the existing variable-length Triton implementation in `BaseFusedOp`.\n- Preserve the public `causal_conv1d_fn` signature and existing `mamba.causal_conv1d_fn` registry key.\n- Keep Triton as the only built-in implementation while allowing out-of-tree platforms to register their own forward method.\n- Add focused coverage for out-of-tree dispatch.\n\nThis PR does not add a Torch reference backend: `forward_native` intentionally raises `NotImplementedError`, and the new test covers only out-of-tree dispatch.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nThe existing numerical tests are unchanged. The added test verifies that an out-of-tree implementation is selected through `BaseFusedOp`.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nThe Triton kernel is unchanged. Dispatch is resolved once and cached by `BaseFusedOp`.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #42165079786](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/42165079786)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #42165079558](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/42165079558)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #42165079698](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/42165079698)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Base CI only covers the core cases, and its workload may not exercise your change. Use `/rerun-test` to run the tests your change touches, or copy this prompt for an agent:\n>\n> ```text\n> Find the registered tests this PR affects and run them with /rerun-test, following https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.agents/skills/rerun-test/SKILL.md\n> ```\n<!-- pr-states:end -->\n",
